                    X_{/f} \to X_{/y} \times_{Y_{/p(y)}} Y_{/p(f)}
            %p
              into the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
              in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sSet"} sSet
              is an acyclic
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+fibration"} Kan fibration
          %p
            This is
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Topos+Theory"} HTT, def 2.4.1.1
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition_3 Proposition
            %p
              The morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
